# kokoro-js pulls onnxruntime-node 1.21.0, whose install script on Linux x64 also downloads the CUDA provider from the
# onnxruntime GitHub release. Those v1.21.0 assets now answer 404, which fails every `npm ci` on Linux (0.15.2 CI,
# 2026-11-18). StarNet runs its voice models on the CPU provider, so the CUDA download is skipped.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
